   <text>
      <body><div><pb facs="#facs_0191_13_07_1324-01" n="0191_13_07_1324-01" xml:id="img_0191_13_07_1324-01"/>
            <ab>
               <l facs="#facs_0191_13_07_1324-01_tr_1_tl_1">Wi jan bode en̄ gherard van wisplaer scepenen in Antwʼpen maken cont</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0191_13_07_1324-01_tr_1_tl_2">Dat vore ons quā rase de pape . en̄ gaf en̄ droech op in gherechtʼ ghe</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0191_13_07_1324-01_tr_1_tl_3">stadeghʼ ghichten . mechiele vuiste . Een ghemec lands . ondʼhalue roede</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0191_13_07_1324-01_tr_1_tl_4">min ghelegen in wilrike achtʼ des selfs mechiels scure . Dat m̄ heet</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0191_13_07_1324-01_tr_1_tl_5">zibbouds rode . Dat welke land de vorseide rase quite scout en̄ bekinde dat</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0191_13_07_1324-01_tr_1_tl_6">hi en gheen recht daer ane en behilt . Jn kinnessen van desen letteʼn beseghelt</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0191_13_07_1324-01_tr_1_tl_7">met onsen seglen . Ghegheuen int jaer ons heʼn alsm̄ screef . M . CCC . ende</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0191_13_07_1324-01_tr_1_tl_8">viere en̄ tuintech . des vridaegs vore aldʼ apostelen dach</l>
            </ab>
      </div></body>
